+    // inversion: subfc/subfe compute rB + ~rA + CA, so CA is the COMPLEMENT of
+    // a borrow, exactly as ARM64's SUBS/SBCS treat it.
+    //
+    // subf-family operands are reversed (subf rt, ra, rb is rb - ra), the same
+    // way sub64 above passes them, so dest = a - b.
