+    // instruction. xxspltw fills all four words from the one it selects, and
+    // the xxpermdi that puts the wanted doubleword in ISA dw0 puts a copy in
+    // dw1 as well.
+    //
+    // The 8- and 16-bit splats are VMX, which can only address the vr half of
+    // the VSR file, so they go through the bridge. Everything here is VSX
+    // 2.06 or VMX, so POWER8 needs no fallback.
+    void vectorDupElement(SIMDLane lane, TrustedImm32 laneIndex, FPRegisterID src, FPRegisterID dest)
